					"content": "那個，綺命姐姐，今天我…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						221161002
					],
					"speakerTitle": "志華"
				},
				{
					"id": 221161002,
					"content": "今天不太適合。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						221161003
					],
					"speakerTitle": "綺命"
				},
				{
					"id": 221161003,
					"content": "咦？可是我還什麼都沒說呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						221161004
					],
					"speakerTitle": "志華"
				},
				{
					"id": 221161004,
					"content": "不用說，我也知道你要說什麼，今天不太合適。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						221161005
					],
					"speakerTitle": "綺命"
				},
				{
					"id": 221161005,
					"content": "那什麼時候才合適，綺命姐姐，不然妳…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						221161006
					],
					"speakerTitle": "志華"
				},
				{
					"id": 221161006,
					"content": "哦，到了合適的那天，當然就會合適了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						221161007
					],
					"speakerTitle": "綺命"
				},
				{
					"id": 221161007,
					"content": "這不和什麼都沒說一樣嘛！綺命姐姐，妳就詳細聽我說說吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						221161008
					],
					"speakerTitle": "志華"
				},
				{
					"id": 221161008,
					"content": "好了，下一位請過來。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						221161009
					],
					"speakerTitle": "綺命"
				},
				{
					"id": 221161009,
					"content": "我還什麼都沒說啊！還有，哪裡有下一位啊？！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "志華"
